{"id":"c4245d68c11920d1","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-upward-absolute.md","title":"ZFC Upward Absolute","display":"df-zfc-upward-absolute — ZFC Upward Absolute","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-upward-absolute","aliases":["58-df-zfc-upward-absolute"],"display":"df-zfc-upward-absolute — ZFC Upward Absolute","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-upward-absolute"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-upward-absolute</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-upward-absolute — ZFC Upward Absolute"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,M,N,\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N,s\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,M,N,\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\in}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\">\\(\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\in}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\\)</span> is the membership-relation symbol</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> (structure projections)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (satisfaction and assignment predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UpwardAbsolute}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UpwardAbsolute}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\in}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M^2\\mid x\\in y\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\in}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M^2\\mid x\\in y\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}upward\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UpwardAbsolute}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nM\\neq\\varnothing\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\n\\land M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_N,N,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\forall s\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\to[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\land(\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s))]\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}upward\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UpwardAbsolute}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nM\\neq\\varnothing\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\n\\land M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_N,N,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\forall s\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\to[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\land(\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s))]\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both induced membership structures and both satisfaction recursions are explicit set witnesses. Thus the definition compares object-structure truth and does not rely on prose-only structures or a metatheoretic satisfaction symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Transitive}$ (transitive-set predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,M,N,\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\in}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transitive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UpwardAbsolute}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\in}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M^2\\mid x\\in y\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}upward\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UpwardAbsolute}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nM\\neq\\varnothing\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\n\\land M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_M,M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_N,N,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\forall s\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\to[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\land(\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s))]\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2652,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3860","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-upward-absolute.md|58-df-zfc-upward-absolute]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["2d9fd66bae7ead5a","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","d9b8711cda3f31ca","64f35ba2e87964e0"]}